@startuml
title Slice 5: 全体統合クラス図
caption 学習・評価・教師管理・AI連携を一つのシステムとしてまとめた全体像

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 15
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

class Student {
  + studentId: String
  + name: String
  + consentStatus: ConsentStatus
  + openTask(task: Task)
  + submit(task: Task)
  + reviewResult()
}

class Teacher {
  + teacherId: String
  + name: String
  + createTask(task: Task)
  + publishTask(task: Task)
  + configurePrompt(prompt: Prompt)
  + configureDistribution(distribution: Distribution)
}

class Task {
  + taskId: String
  + title: String
  + status: TaskStatus
  + promptVersion: String
  + rubricVersion: String
}

class Prompt {
  + promptId: String
  + version: String
  + body: String
  + status: PromptStatus
}

class Rubric {
  + rubricId: String
  + version: String
  + criteria: List<String>
}

class ClassRoom {
  + classId: String
  + name: String
}

class Distribution {
  + distributionId: String
  + status: DistributionStatus
  + schedule: DateTime
}

class Submission {
  + submissionId: String
  + studentId: String
  + taskId: String
  + submittedCode: String
  + status: SubmissionStatus
}

class CodeLog {
  + logId: String
  + studentId: String
  + taskId: String
  + eventType: LogEventType
  + snapshotText: String
  + timestamp: DateTime
}

class ConsentRecord {
  + consentId: String
  + studentId: String
  + taskId: String
  + status: ConsentStatus
  + consentedAt: DateTime
}

class Evaluation {
  + evaluationId: String
  + submissionId: String
  + taskId: String
  + status: EvaluationStatus
  + overallScore: Integer
  + feedback: String
}

class EvaluationRequest {
  + requestId: String
  + taskId: String
  + promptVersion: String
  + rubricVersion: String
  + consentStatus: String
  + generatedJson: String
}

class GeminiAdapter {
  + sendRequest(request: EvaluationRequest): GeminiResponse
}

class GeminiResponse {
  + responseId: String
  + scores: Map<String, Integer>
  + reasons: String
  + confidence: Float
}

Student "1" --> "0..*" Task : 課題を選ぶ
Student "1" --> "0..*" Submission : 提出物を作成
Student "1" --> "0..*" CodeLog : 操作ログを残す
Student "1" --> "0..*" ConsentRecord : 同意状態を保持

Teacher "1" --> "0..*" Task : 課題を作成・公開
Teacher "1" --> "0..*" Prompt : プロンプト設計
Teacher "1" --> "0..*" Distribution : 配信を設定

Task "1" --> "1" Prompt : 評価の入力基準
Task "1" --> "1" Rubric : 評価基準
Task "1" --> "0..*" Submission : 提出対象
Task "1" --> "0..*" CodeLog : 実施ログを持つ

Distribution "1" --> "0..*" ClassRoom : 対象クラスを持つ
ClassRoom "1" --> "0..*" Student : 学生が所属

Submission "1" --> "0..1" Evaluation : 評価結果
Submission "1" --> "0..*" CodeLog : 参照対象ログ

ConsentRecord "1" --> "1" EvaluationRequest : 同意状態を含む
CodeLog "0..*" --> "1" EvaluationRequest : 評価入力を構築
Submission "1" --> "1" EvaluationRequest : 提出内容を含む
Prompt "1" --> "1" EvaluationRequest : 版付きプロンプト
Rubric "1" --> "1" EvaluationRequest : 版付き評定基準

EvaluationRequest "1" --> "1" GeminiAdapter : API入力
GeminiAdapter "1" --> "1" GeminiResponse : 評価結果
GeminiResponse "1" --> "1" Evaluation : 結果を保存

note right of Student
  学生は「学習の進行」と「提出状態」を分離して扱う
end note

note bottom of Teacher
  教師は課題設計・配信・評価設計を別責務で管理する
end note

@enduml
